  "title": "Date-Marshmallow Waldorf Salad",
  "description": "I&#39;ve kept this recipe from my Grandmother. Apples, celery, dates and walnuts are dressed in a light fluffy marshmallow cream. It&#39;s very good and children seem to love it.",
